        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOLinEFshmgEVcfKEftaTBwQ4skMXJiscp1mndfrWdlTPhyxCs8Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "It was time for a new set of dentures. I went on Google and found Esther Blackburn and I am very happy that I did make an appointment with her. Her service was outstanding. She explained everything to me and asked me if I had any questions which I did not really have because her explanation was above and beyond anything I've ever heard before. Before each procedure she explained herself. She explained how it would feel. She explained every procedure. And I was very surprised to hear that they actually use a 3D printer to print the spoon that goes in your mouth to take the shape of your mouth. This was a first for me and I tell you something folks, it is very accurate. I am very happy with what I received, I'm very happy with the courtesy and professionalism I received. The place was spotless. Dr Blackburn was very knowledgeable and took her time explaining everything to me. I did not feel rushed at all.\nIf you need  teeth or anything like that, do give her a call. Outstanding service and an outstanding product!\n\nKudos to you, Doctor",
        "time": 1737931786,
        "translated": false
      },
